  "body": "Follow-up of #1507 (the row -> viewport direction is done there).\n\nWhat: when the pointer is over a picked face, chain or vertex in the viewport, the matching row in the operation's Geometry tab is marked (row background or accent), cleared when the pointer leaves. Ephemeral hover state, no command.\n\nDone means: a ui test hovers a picked feature in the viewport and asserts the row is marked; none after leaving.\n",
